      "markdown": "If you're looking for **smart lock installation in Docklands, VIC**, here are some well-reviewed options that service the area:\n\n- SMART LOCK INSTALLATION – A Melbourne specialist focused on digital and smart locks, supporting many brands (Yale, Lockwood, Aqara, Philips, Schlage, Eufy and more). They also have experience installing locks in apartment buildings around Melbourne. [www.smartlockinstallation.com.au](https://www.smartlockinstallation.com.au/?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n- Port Melbourne Locksmiths – A nearby 24/7 locksmith that installs keyless and digital locks for homes and businesses.\n- MB Locksmiths Melbourne – Mobile locksmith servicing the CBD and surrounding suburbs, including smart lock installations.\n- Southern Cross Locksmiths & Auto Keys – Located in Melbourne CBD and offers 24/7 locksmith services, including digital lock work.\n- Digital Door Locks Pty Ltd – Specialises in digital door locks and can advise on compatible products and installation.\n\nIf you already own a smart lock, most installers can fit customer-supplied models. If you haven't purchased one yet, they can usually recommend a lock that's compatible with your door.\n\nBefore booking, it's worth confirming:\n- Your door type (timber, metal, or apartment fire-rated door).\n- Whether you're replacing an existing deadbolt or installing a new one.\n- The smart lock brand and model.\n- Whether you're in a strata apartment, as some buildings have rules about changing entry hardware. [www.smartlockinstallation.com.au](https://www.smartlockinstallation.com.au/?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n\nIf you tell me:\n- **the smart lock model** (e.g. Yale, Aqara, Lockwood, Eufy), and\n- **whether it's a house or an apartment in Docklands**,\n\nI can help estimate installation cost and identify any compatibility issues before you book.",
